#: gwyddion/tips.c:54
msgid "Holding Shift restricts directions of selected lines to multiples of 15°."
msgstr "按住 Shift 可將所選線段的方向限制為 15° 的整數倍。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:59
msgid "Holding Shift restricts shapes of selected rectangles to perfect squares."
msgstr "按住 Shift 可將所選矩形限制為正方形。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:64
msgid "Holding Shift restricts shapes of selected ellipses to perfect circles."
msgstr "按住 Shift 可將所選橢圓限制為正圓。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:69
msgid "If multiple regions are selected on a graph, e.g. in 1D FFT Filtering, individual regions can be deleted by clicking on them with the right mouse button."
msgstr "如果在曲線圖中選擇了多個區域（例如在一維 FFT 濾波中），可以滑鼠右鍵按一下各區域將其刪除。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:75
msgid "Data presentations created by functions in Data Process → Presentation do not change the underlying data.  All subsequent operations still apply to the underlying data."
msgstr "透過“數據處理 → 表示”中的功能建立的數據表示不會改變底層數據，所有後續操作仍作用於底層數據。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:88
msgid "Pressing Ctrl-F runs the last used data processing function with with the same parameters on the current data."
msgstr "按 Ctrl-F 可在目前數據上使用相同參數執行上一次使用的數據處理功能。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:93
msgid "Pressing Ctrl-Shift-F re-shows the parameter dialog of the last used data processing function (or executes it immediately if it has no parameters)."
msgstr "按 Ctrl-Shift-F 可重新顯示上一次使用的數據處理功能的參數對話方塊（若該功能沒有參數則立即執行）。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:100
msgid "When Gwyddion is run with a directory argument it opens a file open dialog showing this directory."
msgstr "使用目錄作為參數啟動 Gwyddion 時，會開啟顯示該目錄的檔案選擇對話方塊。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:105
msgid "File → Open Recent → Document History opens a browser of recently loaded files with the possibility to search them by name."
msgstr "“檔案 → 開啟最近檔案 → 文件歷史”可開啟最近載入檔案的瀏覽器，並按名稱搜尋。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:111
msgid "Automatic import of unrecognized files as raw data can be enabled/disabled in the Raw file import dialog."
msgstr "可在原始檔案匯入對話方塊中啟用或停用將無法識別的檔案自動作為原始數據匯入。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:116
msgid "To export the image of a channel to a pixmap graphic format (PNG, TIFF, JPEG, ...) just save it as this format with File → Save As."
msgstr "要將通道圖像匯出為點陣圖格式（PNG、TIFF、JPEG 等），使用“檔案 → 另存新檔”將其儲存為對應格式即可。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:122
msgid "File → Merge imports all data from selected file to the current file."
msgstr "“檔案 → 合併”將選中檔案中的所有數據匯入目前檔案。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:127
msgid "Previews in the file open dialog can be shown with plane and/or line leveling applied.  Use the switches at the bottom of the preview list."
msgstr "檔案開啟對話方塊中的預覽可以應用平面調平和／或掃描線調平。使用預覽列表底部的開關進行設定。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:134
msgid "Your favorite false color gradient can be set as default in the gradient editor: Edit → Color Gradients.  The default gradient is shown in bold face."
msgstr "可在漸變編輯器“編輯 → 顏色漸變”中將喜歡的偽彩色漸變設為預設。預設漸變以粗體顯示。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:140
msgid "Your favorite GL material can be set as default in the material editor: Edit → GL Materials.  The default material is shown in bold face."
msgstr "可在材質編輯器“編輯 → GL 材質”中將喜歡的 GL 材質設為預設。預設材質以粗體顯示。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:146
msgid "Edit → Default Mask Color sets the default mask color.  This color is used when a mask is created on data that have not had a mask before."
msgstr "“編輯 → 預設遮罩顏色”可設定預設遮罩顏色。當為此前沒有遮罩的數據建立遮罩時，會使用該顏色。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:152
msgid "Each channel has its own metadata.  Display them by clicking with the right mouse button and choosing Metadata Browser."
msgstr "每個通道都有自己的元資料。以滑鼠右鍵按一下並選擇“元資料瀏覽器”可檢視。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:158
msgid "Each volume data have their own metadata.  Display them by clicking with the right mouse button and choosing Metadata Browser."
msgstr "每組體數據都有自己的元資料。以滑鼠右鍵按一下並選擇“元資料瀏覽器”可檢視。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:164
msgid "A record of applied data processing operations can be browsed using View Log in the channel or volume data right-click menu."
msgstr "可透過通道或體數據的右鍵選單中的“檢視日誌”瀏覽已執行的數據處理操作記錄。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:170
msgid "Curves can be copied to other (compatible) graphs by dragging them from Curves tab to the graph window."
msgstr "將曲線從“曲線”索引標籤拖到曲線圖視窗，可將曲線複製到其他兼容的曲線圖。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:175
msgid "Graph curve properties can be edited by clicking on the curve."
msgstr "按一下曲線圖中的曲線可編輯其屬性。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:179
msgid "Graph axis labels can be edited after by clicking on the label."
msgstr "按一下曲線圖軸標籤可編輯標籤。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:183
msgid "Graph key (legend) properties can be edited by double-clicking on the legend."
msgstr "按兩下圖例可編輯圖例屬性。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:188
msgid "Curves can be deleted from graphs by selecting the curve in Curves tab and pressing Delete."
msgstr "在“曲線”索引標籤中選擇曲線並按 Delete，可從曲線圖中刪除該曲線。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:194
msgid "Key ‛+’ or ‛=’ zooms in a data window."
msgstr "按“+”或“=”鍵可放大數據視窗。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:198
msgid "Key ‛-’ (minus) zooms out a data window."
msgstr "按“-”（減號）鍵可縮小數據視窗。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:202
msgid "Key ‛Z’ resets data window zoom to 1:1."
msgstr "按“Z”鍵可將數據視窗縮放重置為 1:1。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:206
msgid "Data with different <i>x</i> and <i>y</i> measures can be displayed either with pixel-wise or realistic aspect ratio.  The menu in data window top left corner enables switching between these two modes."
msgstr "<i>x</i> 和 <i>y</i> 方向尺寸不同的數據既可以按像素比例顯示，也可以按實際比例顯示。使用數據視窗左上角的選單可切換這兩種模式。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:213
msgid "Clicking on a false color scale with the right mouse button brings a false color gradient selector."
msgstr "以滑鼠右鍵按一下偽彩色色標可開啟偽彩色漸變選擇器。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:218
msgid "Mask color can be changed by right-clicking on a data view and selecting Mask Color from the menu."
msgstr "以滑鼠右鍵按一下數據檢視並在選單中選擇“遮罩顏色”，可更改遮罩顏色。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:224
msgid "Clicking on a 3D view with the right mouse button brings a GL material or false color gradient selector."
msgstr "以滑鼠右鍵按一下三維檢視可開啟 GL 材質或偽彩色漸變選擇器。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:229
msgid "3D view transformation modes can be selected with keys: R (rotate), S (scale), V (value scale) and L (light source)."
msgstr "可用以下按鍵選擇三維檢視變換模式：R（旋轉）、S（縮放）、V（數值比例）和 L（光源）。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:234
msgid "You can make a specific 3D view setup the default using the Set as Default button."
msgstr "使用“設為預設”按鈕可將目前三維檢視設定設為預設。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:240
msgid "Pressing Ctrl-C copies the image of a channel, graph or 3D view to the clipboard."
msgstr "按 Ctrl-C 可將通道、曲線圖或三維檢視的圖像複製到剪貼簿。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:245
msgid "Dragging channels or graphs from Data Browser to a window copies them to the corresponding file."
msgstr "將通道或曲線圖從數據瀏覽器拖到視窗，可將它們複製到相應檔案。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:250
msgid "Info → Show Data Browser brings back a closed Data Browser."
msgstr "“資訊 → 顯示數據瀏覽器”可重新顯示已關閉的數據瀏覽器。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:254
msgid "Channels and graphs can be renamed by double-clicking on their name in Data Browser."
msgstr "在數據瀏覽器中按兩下通道或曲線圖的名稱可將其重命名。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:260
msgid "Facet Level offers to use/exclude the masked area if a mask is present on the data."
msgstr "如果數據中存在遮罩，“面片調平”允許使用或排除遮罩區域。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:265
msgid "Plane Level offers to use/exclude the masked area if a mask is present on the data."
msgstr "如果數據中存在遮罩，“平面調平”允許使用或排除遮罩區域。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:270
msgid "Align Rows offers to use/exclude the masked area if a mask is present on the data."
msgstr "如果數據中存在遮罩，“對齊掃描行”允許使用或排除遮罩區域。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:275
msgid "Data Arithmetic works as a scientific calculator: just type an arithmetic expression."
msgstr "“數據運算”可用作科學計算機：只需輸入一個算術表達式。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:280
msgid "Data Arithmetic expressions can include values (d), mask values (m), derivatives (bx, by) and coordinates (x, y)."
msgstr "數據運算表達式可包含數值（d）、遮罩值（m）、導數（bx、by）和座標（x、y）。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:285
msgid "Facet Level can often level data with large features that make impossible to use standard plane leveling.  It levels the surface by making normals of flat areas point upwards."
msgstr "對於含有大型特徵、無法使用標準平面調平的數據，“面片調平”通常仍然有效。它透過使平坦區域的法線朝上來調平表面。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:291
msgid "Flatten Base performs automated leveling of base flat surface with positive features."
msgstr "“基底平坦化”可自動調平帶有向上凸起特徵的平坦基底。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:296
msgid "Too small grains can be filtered out with Data Process → Grains → Filter."
msgstr "透過“數據處理 → 顆粒 → 篩選”可濾除過小的顆粒。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:301
msgid "Data Process → Presentation → Edge Detection → Step is a fine step detector with a good dynamic range"
msgstr "“數據處理 → 表示 → 邊緣檢測 → 階躍”是一種動態範圍良好的精細階躍檢測方法。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:306
msgid "Data Process → Basic Operations → Dimensions and Units changes scales, offsets and even lateral and value units."
msgstr "“數據處理 → 基本操作 → 尺寸和單位”可更改比例、偏移量，甚至橫向單位與數值單位。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:311
msgid "Grains or other areas of interest are marked with masks.  Many functions then can do something interesting with the masked areas."
msgstr "顆粒或其他感興趣區域使用遮罩標記，許多功能可以對遮罩區域進行處理。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:317
msgid "Remove Scars in the toolbox runs with the settings last used in Mark Scars."
msgstr "工具箱中的“去除劃痕”使用“標記劃痕”上次使用的設定執行。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:322
msgid "Data synthesis modules can be also used to modify existing images."
msgstr "數據合成模組也可用於修改現有圖像。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:327
msgid "Data Process → Mask → Mark With can set the image mask based on another data, mask or presentation."
msgstr "“數據處理 → 遮罩 → 標記依據”可根據其他數據、遮罩或表示設定圖像遮罩。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:333
msgid "Graph → Critical Dimension measures steps on extracted profile graphs."
msgstr "“曲線圖 → 臨界尺寸”可測量提取的輪廓圖中的階躍。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:338
msgid "All Graph functions are available also in the graph right-click menu."
msgstr "所有“曲線圖”功能也可透過曲線圖右鍵選單使用。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:344
msgid "Pressing Esc hides tool windows."
msgstr "按 Esc 可隱藏工具視窗。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:348
msgid "Read Value tool displays also the local facet normal."
msgstr "“讀取數值”工具還會顯示局部面片法線。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:352
msgid "Read Value tool can shift data to make <i>z</i>=0 plane pass through the selected point."
msgstr "“讀取數值”工具可平移數據，使 <i>z</i>=0 平面穿過選定點。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:357
msgid "Individual lines can be deleted in Distance tool by selecting them in the list and pressing Delete."
msgstr "在“距離”工具的列表中選擇單條線並按 Delete，可將其刪除。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:362
msgid "Individual lines can be deleted in Profiles tool by selecting them in the list and pressing Delete."
msgstr "在“輪廓”工具的列表中選擇單條線並按 Delete，可將其刪除。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:367
msgid "Spectroscopy tool displays point spectroscopy data and extracts them to standalone graphs that can be subsequently analysed for instance with Graph → Fit FD Curve."
msgstr "“光譜”工具可顯示點光譜數據，並將其提取為獨立曲線圖；之後可對其分析，例如使用“曲線圖 → 擬合力-距離曲線”。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:373
msgid "Statistical Quantities tool allows limiting the area of interest by a mask, rectangular selection or the intersection of both."
msgstr "“統計量”工具允許使用遮罩、矩形選區或二者的交集來限定感興趣區域。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:378
msgid "Beside height and angle distributions, Statistical Functions tool calculates also correlation functions, power spectrum density (PSDF) and some more exotic functions."
msgstr "除了高度和角度分佈，“統計函數”工具還可計算相關函數、功率譜密度函數（PSDF）及其他一些較少見的函數。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:384
msgid "Path Level tool levels misaligned rows by lining them up along manually selected lines.  If there are no large features automatic Align Rows usually works well."
msgstr "“路徑調平”工具透過沿手動選擇的線對齊掃描行，來校正未對齊的行。如果沒有大型特徵，自動“對齊掃描行”通常效果良好。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:390
msgid "Grain Measure tool is great for examining individual grains.  Overall grain statistics are available in Data Processing → Grains."
msgstr "“顆粒測量”工具適合檢查單個顆粒。整體顆粒統計可透過“數據處理 → 顆粒”獲得。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:396
msgid "Mask Editor tool can create, edit, invert, grow and shrink masks."
msgstr "“遮罩編輯器”工具可建立、編輯、反轉、擴張和收縮遮罩。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:400
msgid "Color Range tool offers several false color scale mapping modes and can make any of them the default mode."
msgstr "“顏色範圍”工具提供多種偽彩色色標映射模式，並可將其中任意一種設為預設模式。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:405
msgid "Dragging selections from Selections Manager tool to a data window copies the selection to the target data."
msgstr "將選區從“選區管理器”工具拖到數據視窗，可將選區複製到目標數據。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:411
msgid "Pressing F1 or the Help buttons in most windows shows a relevant part of the user guide in a web browser."
msgstr "在大多數視窗中按 F1 或按一下“說明”按鈕，可在網頁瀏覽器中顯示用戶手冊的相關內容。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:416
msgid "Gwyddion User Guide explains in detail many of the methods and algorithms implemented in Gwyddion."
msgstr "Gwyddion 用戶手冊詳細說明了 Gwyddion 實現的許多方法和算法。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:421
msgid "Gwyddion is a son of Math."
msgstr "Gwyddion 是 Math 的兒子。"

